    A["Java 7 (Anonymous Classes, Null Checks, Verbose IO)"] --> B["Java 8 (2014) LTS — Lambdas + Streams + Optional + Date/Time"]
    B --> C["Java 9 (2017) — Module System (JPMS) + Collection Factories"]
